            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EAI-powered workflow engine for Umbraco. Define multi-step agent workflows in YAML and run them from the backoffice. Ships with three ready-to-run examples: Umbraco Content Audit (analyses your site\u0026#39;s content tree), Content Quality Audit (scores any public URL), and Accessibility Quick-Scan (WCAG 2.1 AA findings). Extensible tool system \u2014 add custom tools for your editorial workflows. Apache 2.0 licensed, built on Umbraco.AI.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/agentrun.umbraco\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
